  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening community response to the proliferation of violence in crisis affected Northwest Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This measure measure will respond to the multifaceted security crisis and the growing risk of further escalation in the Northwest of Nigeria through stabilisation activities aimed at securing peace dividends by enhancing livelihoods, increasing resilience and strengthening community-centred mediation capacities. This action also foresees a component on countering the weaponisation of disinformation and hate speech in the Northwest of Nigeria, curbing emerging violence by strengthening information integrity, empowering local communities with critical media literacy, and fostering a resilient information ecosystem that resists manipulation and incitement to conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
